#. type: Title =
#: ../Documentation/RelNotes/2.47.1.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Git 2.47.1 Release Notes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation/RelNotes/2.47.1.txt:6
msgid ""
"This is to flush accumulated fixes since 2.47.0 on the 'master' front down "
"to the maintenance track."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation/RelNotes/2.47.1.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fixes since Git 2.47"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation/RelNotes/2.47.1.txt:13
msgid ""
"Use after free and double freeing at the end in \"git log -L... -p\" had "
"been identified and fixed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation/RelNotes/2.47.1.txt:17
msgid ""
"On macOS, fsmonitor can fall into a race condition that results in a client "
"waiting forever to be notified for an event that have already happened.  "
"This problem has been corrected."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation/RelNotes/2.47.1.txt:20
msgid ""
"\"git maintenance start\" crashed due to an uninitialized variable "
"reference, which has been corrected."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation/RelNotes/2.47.1.txt:23
msgid ""
"Fail gracefully instead of crashing when attempting to write the contents of "
"a corrupt in-core index as a tree object."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation/RelNotes/2.47.1.txt:27
msgid ""
"A \"git fetch\" from the superproject going down to a submodule used a wrong "
"remote when the default remote names are set differently between them."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation/RelNotes/2.47.1.txt:30
msgid ""
"The \"gitk\" project tree has been synchronized again with its new "
"maintainer, Johannes Sixt."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation/RelNotes/2.47.1.txt:31
msgid "Also contains minor documentation updates and code clean-ups."
msgstr ""
